命令范例

OpenUsbkey: UniversalDllLoader.exe call --dll .\EncryptionMachine\ServerModelEncryptionMachine\WinSocketServer.dll --function OpenUsbkey
LgServer: UniversalDllLoader.exe call --dll .\EncryptionMachine\ServerModelEncryptionMachine\WinSocketServer.dll --function LgServer --arg string=127.0.0.1 --arg ushort=8001 --arg int=8 --arg string=11111111
LgoutServer: UniversalDllLoader.exe call --dll .\EncryptionMachine\ServerModelEncryptionMachine\WinSocketServer.dll --function LgoutServer
CreateRand: UniversalDllLoader.exe call --dll .\EncryptionMachine\ServerModelEncryptionMachine\WinSocketServer.dll --function CreateRand --return int --arg int=16 --arg StringBuilder[1024]=
脚本执行

内容 scenario.json:
{
  "searchPaths": ["./EncryptionMachine/ServerModelEncryptionMachine"],
  "commands": [
    { "type": "load", "path": "./EncryptionMachine/ServerModelEncryptionMachine/WinSocketServer.dll", "alias": "WinSocket" },
    { "type": "call", "alias": "WinSocket", "function": "OpenUsbkey" },
    { "type": "call", "alias": "WinSocket", "function": "LgServer", "args": ["string=127.0.0.1", "ushort=8001", "int=8", "string=11111111"] },
    { "type": "call", "alias": "WinSocket", "function": "CreateRand", "args": ["int=16", "StringBuilder[1024]="] },
    { "type": "call", "alias": "WinSocket", "function": "LgoutServer" },
    { "type": "unload", "alias": "WinSocket" }
  ]
}
执行：UniversalDllLoader.exe run scenario.json
返回解析

成功调用示例输出：
{
  "succeeded": true,
  "command": "LgServer",
  "returnCode": 0,
  "error": null,
  "detail": null,
  "outputs": []
}
带 StringBuilder 参数的输出：
{
  "succeeded": true,
  "command": "CreateRand",
  "returnCode": 0,
  "error": null,
  "detail": null,
  "outputs": [
    { "index": 1, "type": "StringBuilder", "value": "5A3E...", "isOutput": true }
  ]
}
常用参数说明

网络地址/口令使用 string=；端口为 ushort=；长度为 int=。
若 DLL 不在当前目录，可加 --search-path C:\Path\To\dlls 或在脚本 searchPaths 中配置。
调用后默认卸载 DLL；如需保持加载状态，追加 --keep-loaded。